{
  "scene": "script_0792.obj",
  "dialogues": [
    {
      "offset": 152,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "よく考えなければならない。",
      "en": "A small -- dream.",
      "text": "A small -- dream."
    },
    {
      "offset": 183,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "俺には――音夢には後少しの時間しか残されて\nいない。",
      "en": "\"That cherry tree......\"",
      "text": "\"That cherry tree......\""
    },
    {
      "offset": 239,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "その短い時間のうちであいつがすること。",
      "en": "The cherry tree which had appeared in my dreams many times.",
      "text": "The cherry tree which had appeared in my dreams many times."
    },
    {
      "offset": 282,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "願い。",
      "en": "A strange disease, which causes memories to turn into cherry\nblossom petals and come out of her body.",
      "text": "A strange disease, which causes memories to turn into cherry\nblossom petals and come out of her body."
    },
    {
      "offset": 293,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "夢。",
      "en": "If that disease is one unbelievable thing on this island,\nthen the other unbelievable thing would be that everlasting\ncherry tree.",
      "text": "If that disease is one unbelievable thing on this island,\nthen the other unbelievable thing would be that everlasting\ncherry tree."
    },
    {
      "offset": 302,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "ささやかな――夢。",
      "en": "\"Nemu.\"",
      "text": "\"Nemu.\""
    },
    {
      "offset": 327,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "「あの桜の木……」",
      "en": "I put on my jacket in a hurry and I ran to the cherry\ntree......",
      "text": "I put on my jacket in a hurry and I ran to the cherry\ntree......"
    },
    {
      "offset": 352,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "何度も夢に出てきた桜。",
      "en": "I ran to Nemu.",
      "text": "I ran to Nemu."
    },
    {
      "offset": 379,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "身体から記憶の花びらがこぼれる奇病。",
      "en": ". . .",
      "text": ". . ."
    },
    {
      "offset": 420,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "この島において、音夢の病がありえない存在だ\nとしたら、それと同じモノはやはりあの枯れな\nい桜しかない。",
      "en": ". . .",
      "text": ". . ."
    },
    {
      "offset": 527,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "「音夢」",
      "en": ". . .",
      "text": ". . ."
    },
    {
      "offset": 542,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "俺は急いで上着を羽織ると、桜を――。",
      "en": ". . .",
      "text": ". . ."
    },
    {
      "offset": 583,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "音夢を目指して走り出した。",
      "en": "\"Hah...... hah......\"",
      "text": "\"Hah...... hah......\""
    },
    {
      "offset": 651,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "・\n・\n・",
      "en": "My heart aches.",
      "text": "My heart aches."
    },
    {
      "offset": 695,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "・\n・\n・",
      "en": "It's throbbing pain.",
      "text": "It's throbbing pain."
    },
    {
      "offset": 743,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "・\n・\n・",
      "en": "\"Nemu?\"",
      "text": "\"Nemu?\""
    },
    {
      "offset": 792,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "・\n・\n・",
      "en": "I looked around in surprise.",
      "text": "I looked around in surprise."
    },
    {
      "offset": 807,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "「……はぁはぁ……はぁはぁ」",
      "en": "No.",
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "offset": 842,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "胸が痛い。",
      "en": "Nemu isn't here.",
      "text": "Nemu isn't here."
    },
    {
      "offset": 857,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "凍える痛さだ。",
      "en": "Not here.",
      "text": "Not here."
    },
    {
      "offset": 878,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "「はぁ……音夢？」",
      "en": "\"............\"",
      "text": "\"............\""
    },
    {
      "offset": 903,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "辺りを見渡して｛がくぜん／愕然｝とする。",
      "en": "My knees gave in suddenly.",
      "text": "My knees gave in suddenly."
    },
    {
      "offset": 948,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "違う。",
      "en": "The mountains of cherry blossoms covered my body from every\ndirection. They kept falling on me as if they're trying to\nsteal my heart.",
      "text": "The mountains of cherry blossoms covered my body from every\ndirection. They kept falling on me as if they're trying to\nsteal my heart."
    },
    {
      "offset": 959,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "音夢はここにはいない。",
      "en": "I can't make it in time.",
      "text": "I can't make it in time."
    },
    {
      "offset": 986,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "ここにはいない。",
      "en": "\"Nemu's dream is a small wish.\"",
      "text": "\"Nemu's dream is a small wish.\""
    },
    {
      "offset": 1009,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "「…………」",
      "en": "\"............?\"",
      "text": "\"............?\""
    },
    {
      "offset": 1028,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "がさり、と膝が折れた。",
      "en": "\"It's not about this everlasting tree. It's a much smaller\ndream.\"",
      "text": "\"It's not about this everlasting tree. It's a much smaller\ndream.\""
    },
    {
      "offset": 1055,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "うず高く積もった桜に四肢をからめとられ、降\nり注ぐ花びらに心をとらわれた。",
      "en": "\"Sakura......\"",
      "text": "\"Sakura......\""
    },
    {
      "offset": 1133,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "間に合わない。",
      "en": "I saw her blonde hair in between the forests of cherry\ntrees.",
      "text": "I saw her blonde hair in between the forests of cherry\ntrees."
    },
    {
      "offset": 1167,
      "speaker": "Sakura",
      "speaker_jp": "さくら",
      "jp": "「音夢の夢はささやかな願い」",
      "en": "\"Don't you worry...... let me handle it, oniichan.\"",
      "text": "\"Don't you worry...... let me handle it, oniichan.\""
    },
    {
      "offset": 1329,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "奥の見えない桜の林の中から、月のように金色\nをした髪がのぞく。",
      "en": "\"Handle what?\"",
      "text": "\"Handle what?\""
    },
    {
      "offset": 1498,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "と、ざわざわ、と桜の花びらが騒ぎ出す。",
      "en": "Then, the cherry blossom starts to rustle.",
      "text": "Then, the cherry blossom starts to rustle."
    },
    {
      "offset": 1556,
      "speaker": "Sakura",
      "speaker_jp": "さくら",
      "jp": "「だから夢を見てて……」",
      "en": "\"You keep dreaming......\"",
      "text": "\"You keep dreaming......\""
    },
    {
      "offset": 1587,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "頭が朦朧としてきた。",
      "en": "My head became dim.",
      "text": "My head became dim."
    },
    {
      "offset": 1627,
      "speaker": "Sakura",
      "speaker_jp": "さくら",
      "jp": "「幸せな夢を……」",
      "en": "\"A happy dream......\"",
      "text": "\"A happy dream......\""
    },
    {
      "offset": 1652,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "身体から力が抜けていく。",
      "en": "I can't help losing my strength.",
      "text": "I can't help losing my strength."
    },
    {
      "offset": 1696,
      "speaker": "Sakura",
      "speaker_jp": "さくら",
      "jp": "「夢だと知らずに……」",
      "en": "\"Without knowing that it's a dream......\"",
      "text": "\"Without knowing that it's a dream......\""
    },
    {
      "offset": 1725,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "まぶたが……落ちる……。",
      "en": "My eyelids are dropping......",
      "text": "My eyelids are dropping......"
    },
    {
      "offset": 1790,
      "speaker": "Sakura",
      "speaker_jp": "さくら",
      "jp": "「そこは繰り返す日常」",
      "en": "\"Back in the repeating everyday life.\"",
      "text": "\"Back in the repeating everyday life.\""
    },
    {
      "offset": 1832,
      "speaker": "Sakura",
      "speaker_jp": "さくら",
      "jp": "「当たり前の人と、当たり前の１日」",
      "en": "\"Everybody you know, and the normal day.\"",
      "text": "\"Everybody you know, and the normal day.\""
    },
    {
      "offset": 1886,
      "speaker": "Sakura",
      "speaker_jp": "さくら",
      "jp": "「悪いことじゃないんだよ」",
      "en": "\"It isn't a bad thing.\"",
      "text": "\"It isn't a bad thing.\""
    },
    {
      "offset": 1932,
      "speaker": "Sakura",
      "speaker_jp": "さくら",
      "jp": "「それが夢なんだから……」",
      "en": "\"That's what her dream's all about......\"",
      "text": "\"That's what her dream's all about......\""
    },
    {
      "offset": 2080,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "◆枯れない桜へ◆",
      "en": "◆I have to think hard.◆",
      "text": "◆I have to think hard.◆"
    },
    {
      "offset": 2133,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "音夢のささやかな夢を叶えるために、俺はあの\n桜のもとに走った。",
      "en": "I don't have -- Nemu doesn't have much time left.",
      "text": "I don't have -- Nemu doesn't have much time left."
    },
    {
      "offset": 2199,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "でも、そこに音夢はいなかった。",
      "en": "What would she want to do within that little time?",
      "text": "What would she want to do within that little time?"
    },
    {
      "offset": 2234,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "がくり、と膝を落とす俺の前にあらわれたさく\nら。",
      "en": "A wish.",
      "text": "A wish."
    },
    {
      "offset": 2286,
      "speaker": "",
      "speaker_jp": "",
      "jp": "俺はさくらの言葉に意識を失って……。",
      "en": "A dream.",
      "text": "A dream."
    }
  ],
